[en.IDEA_C08_NEVER_FORGET]
Never Forget

[en.IDEA_C08_NEVER_FORGET_desc]
Ponies will never forget what Cozy Glow has done. She imprisoned Princess Celestia and Princess Luna, broke the friendship between the three tribes, and erased Princess Twilight Sparkle and her friends from every record. She may think that without bodies, prisons, or files, ponies will stop asking questions. She is wrong. She destroyed Equestria's harmony and stole its bright future. This will not end here.

§RCozy Glow, you are next.§!

[zh.IDEA_C08_NEVER_FORGET]
永不遗忘

[zh.IDEA_C08_NEVER_FORGET_desc]
小马们永远不会忘记和煦光流所做的一切。是她囚禁了塞拉斯蒂娅和露娜公主，是她打破了三族间的友谊，也是她让暮光闪闪公主和她的朋友们从所有记录中消失。她或许以为，只要没有尸体、没有牢房、没有档案，小马们就会停止追问。但她错了。她毁掉了小马利亚的谐律，夺走了小马们的光明未来。这件事不会就这么了结。

§R和煦光流，你就是下一个。§!
